 "createdAt": "2019-02-20T17:44:21+00:00",
 "description": "<p>ALPHV (aka BlackCat) is a ransomware operator group discovered in December 2021.<br>ALPHV ransomware is written in Rust and uses AES or ChaCha to encrypt the victim's data.&nbsp;<br>Once data is encrypted, ransomware uploads it to a remote server.</p><p>First discovered on 2021-12-09.</p><p>The ALPHV had DLS: hxxp://alphvmmm27o3abo3r2mlmjrpdmzle3rykajqc5xsj7j7ejksbpsa36ad[.]onion/</p><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Screenshot DLS:<img src=\"/api/v2/hi/threat_actor/a35fd1154b5308a41e5d248df00e8c94670a86e0/file/2630a09ef75e3eebada65b484b6d19c168960d4c82f19be43495595e31397cd1?placeholder=__IMAGE_a35fd1154b5308a41e5d248df00e8c94670a86e0:2630a09ef75e3eebada65b484b6d19c168960d4c82f19be43495595e31397cd1_IMAGE__\"  /></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>ALPHV has advertisements of affiliates recruitment on undergroumd forums:<br>https://tap.group-ib.com/ta/actors/?ta=a35fd1154b5308a41e5d248df00e8c94670a86e0&amp;tab=timeline&amp;reportId=b557eedcbc4bad806d3444ad94e367bffe6014a1</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>According to Varonis, ALPHV group is actively recruiting ex-REvil, BlackMatter, and DarkSide operators.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>According to Symantec researchers, FIN7 is an owner of ALPHV (aka BlackCat/Noberus) Raas. ALPHV emerged shortly after BlackMatter announced it was being retired.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>In March 2022 threat actors updated their loсker started to name themeselves “ALPHV MORPH”.<br><br>TTPs of ALPHV ransomware: https://tap.group-ib.com/ta/actors?ta=a35fd1154b5308a41e5d248df00e8c94670a86e0&amp;tab=timeline&amp;reportId=27c12c24ad6defe73fde90ef6c7da2f6fa9e92cd</p><p><br>Stitstics of ALPHV victims in 2022 by countries and by months is available in the report https://tap.group-ib.com/ta/actors?ta=a35fd1154b5308a41e5d248df00e8c94670a86e0&amp;tab=timeline&amp;reportId=00a78decb48cfdc40d3fb8ced75090308962f6a5</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>In June 2023 researchers detected a new tactic for delivery of ALPHV - WinSCP malvertising. Also threat actors used new anti-AV and anti-EDR tool SpyBoy which is sold in underground:</p><p>https://tap.group-ib.com/ta/actors?ta=a35fd1154b5308a41e5d248df00e8c94670a86e0&amp;tab=timeline&amp;reportId=48852b71418c593f9ce49a45905cdb0e4019dc0e</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>December 19, 2023 - The AlphV/Blackcat ransomware gang's darknet website was replaced on 19th of December by a notice indicating its seizure by the FBI.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
